#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:8
msgid "Exception"
msgstr "Exception"

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:13
msgid ""
"All exceptions have readable ``value`` and ``errno`` attributes, not just "
"``StopIteration`` and ``OSError``."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les exceptions possèdent des attributs ``value`` et ``errno`` "
"lisibles, pas seulement ``StopIteration`` et ``OSError``."

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:15
msgid "**Cause:** MicroPython is optimised to reduce code size."
msgstr "**Cause :** MicroPython est optimisé pour réduire la taille du code."

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Only use ``value`` on ``StopIteration`` exceptions, and "
"``errno`` on ``OSError`` exceptions.  Do not use or rely on these attributes"
" on other exceptions."
msgstr ""
"**Contournement :** N'utilisez ``value`` que sur les exceptions "
"``StopIteration``, et ``errno`` que sur les exceptions ``OSError``. "
"N'utilisez pas ces attributs sur d'autres exceptions et ne vous y fiez pas."

